\newlabel{tab:pts-gpu-audited}{{4}{7}{M1 PTS-GPU run-held-out comparison on the paper's log-mean target (five runs, one session). All rows use the same held-out runs. History mean uses the other four training labels; execution-free proxies use static hardware features; BenchScout uses host context and selected probes. Cost is the estimated new measurement budget, not model-training or end-to-end serving time}{table.caption.35}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Supplied online PTS-GPU case studies. Values are separate from run-held-out results: the M1 target overlaps model selection and M6/T4 logs are unavailable. Cost denotes selected-probe time; M1 context collection adds 7.93\,s.}}{7}{table.caption.36}\protected@file@percent }
